  timeScale: 0
  _text: "This app requires a decent <wave>internet connection.</wave> \nIt may not
    perform well when the connection is unreliable, such as in space, underwater,
    inside a volcano, or in a subway tunnel. \nPlease refrain from whistling or jumping
    while using the app. Do not expose the app to boiling conditions. \nNot to be
    used in the North Pole. Do not cook. \n- Designed for well-behaved children.
    \n- We believe in Santa Claus."
  useDynamicScaling: 0
  referenceFontSize: 10
  isResettingTimeOnNewText: 1
